{"id":"vod_lz_26919","vodId":"26919","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"潮与虎2015","name_cn":"潮与虎2015","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220717-1/edb545c57a180e80e4d3792346eb93d9.jpg"},"summary":"苍月潮（畠中祐 配音）是一位身体瘦弱的平凡国中生，一次偶然中，潮在地下室里遇见了一只被封印长达五百年之久的妖怪，并于无意之中拔出了封印它的“兽茅”，使得妖怪重返人间。潮身上所爆发出来的惊人力量令妖怪震惊，它当即表示臣服于潮，于是，潮替妖怪取名“虎”（小山力也 配音）。　　成为了兽茅的继承人，潮的肩上负担起了斩妖除魔维护和平的使命，各路妖怪亦循迹而来，向他发出了挑战。在不断的合作和战斗之中，潮和虎之间结下了深厚的友谊，而两人亦被卷入了一个波及到整个世界的阴谋之中，而躲在兽茅背后的各路人马也一一出现在潮的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-07-17 02:46:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18346_16ee03dd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18347_9878eaf6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18348_34b51aaf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18349_77b64d6f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18350_98aece1b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18351_6186bc8c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18352_128fa480/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18354_43ea69bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18353_ec0028bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18355_fe36f290/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18357_a6ad02c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18358_024e67a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18356_9b13cedb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220715/18359_b38c74b0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz